{"seq":3,"slug":"refactoring-strategies","title":"重构策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-craftsmanship/tech-debt-engineering/refactoring-strategies","wordCount":1433,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"重构策略\">重构策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>重构是在不改变外部行为的前提下改善内部结构；它的核心风险不是改不好，而是改出新 Bug，因此安全重构靠的是纪律与按规模匹配的策略，而非某种&quot;高明&quot;手法。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>小步前进</strong>：在有测试保护的前提下做小步修改，保持代码始终可部署。</li>\n<li><strong>规模决定策略</strong>：函数/类级别直接重构，模块级别视是否改接口选分支抽象或并行变更，系统级别选绞杀者模式或 Mikado 方法。</li>\n<li><strong>绞杀者模式</strong>：新实现在旧系统旁逐步生长，最终替换旧系统，避免一次性重写。</li>\n<li><strong>分支抽象</strong>：在接口层引入抽象，使新旧实现可切换，隔离变更影响。</li>\n<li><strong>并行变更</strong>：先扩展新旧并存，再迁移，最后收缩，避免中断调用方。</li>\n<li><strong>安全网</strong>：测试策略与 Feature Flag 是两道保险，让重构可随时回退。</li>\n<li><strong>Mikado 方法</strong>：用依赖关系图规划最小改动路径，适合深度耦合的遗留结构。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本文后续的绞杀者模式、分支抽象、Mikado、并行变更与安全网，都是这些概念的具体展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安全重构的原则\">安全重构的原则</h2><p>重构是在不改变外部行为的前提下改善代码内部结构的过程。重构最大的风险不是改不好，而是改出新 Bug。因此安全重构的第一原则是：<strong>在有测试保护的前提下进行小步修改</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[识别重构目标] --&gt; B{有测试覆盖?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[小步重构]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[先补测试]&#10;    D --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; E[运行测试]&#10;    E --&gt; F{测试通过?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[提交]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[撤销修改]&#10;    H --&gt; C&#10;    G --&gt; I{重构完成?}&#10;    I --&gt;|否| C&#10;    I --&gt;|是| J[完成]\">flowchart TD\n    A[识别重构目标] --&gt; B{有测试覆盖?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[小步重构]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[先补测试]\n    D --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; E[运行测试]\n    E --&gt; F{测试通过?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[提交]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[撤销修改]\n    H --&gt; C\n    G --&gt; I{重构完成?}\n    I --&gt;|否| C\n    I --&gt;|是| J[完成]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"绞杀者模式-strangler-fig-pattern\">绞杀者模式（Strangler Fig Pattern）</h2><p>绞杀者模式是最安全的大规模重构策略——不是一次性替换旧系统，而是逐步在旧系统周围构建新系统，直到旧系统被完全替代。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;阶段 1: 共存&quot;&#10;    A1[用户请求] --&gt; B1[路由层]&#10;    B1 --&gt; C1[新代码: 功能 A]&#10;    B1 --&gt; D1[旧代码: 功能 B, C, D]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;阶段 2: 逐步替换&quot;&#10;    A2[用户请求] --&gt; B2[路由层]&#10;    B2 --&gt; C2[新代码: 功能 A, B]&#10;    B2 --&gt; D2[旧代码: 功能 C, D]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;阶段 3: 完成&quot;&#10;    A3[用户请求] --&gt; B3[路由层]&#10;    B3 --&gt; C3[新代码: 功能 A, B, C, D]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"阶段 1: 共存\"\n    A1[用户请求] --&gt; B1[路由层]\n    B1 --&gt; C1[新代码: 功能 A]\n    B1 --&gt; D1[旧代码: 功能 B, C, D]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"阶段 2: 逐步替换\"\n    A2[用户请求] --&gt; B2[路由层]\n    B2 --&gt; C2[新代码: 功能 A, B]\n    B2 --&gt; D2[旧代码: 功能 C, D]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"阶段 3: 完成\"\n    A3[用户请求] --&gt; B3[路由层]\n    B3 --&gt; C3[新代码: 功能 A, B, C, D]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"实现方式\">实现方式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface FeatureRouter {&#10;  route(request: Request): Promise&lt;Response&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;class StranglerRouter implements FeatureRouter {&#10;  constructor(&#10;    private readonly newService: FeatureRouter,&#10;    private readonly legacyService: FeatureRouter,&#10;    private readonly featureFlags: FeatureFlagService,&#10;  ) {}&#10;&#10;  async route(request: Request): Promise&lt;Response&gt; {&#10;    const path = new URL(request.url).pathname;&#10;&#10;    if (await this.featureFlags.isEnabled(`new-${path}`)) {&#10;      return this.newService.route(request);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    return this.legacyService.route(request);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FeatureRouter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  route</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">request</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StranglerRouter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> implements</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FeatureRouter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> newService</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FeatureRouter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> legacyService</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FeatureRouter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> featureFlags</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FeatureFlagService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ) {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> route</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">request</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request.url).pathname;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.featureFlags.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isEnabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`new-${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">path</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.newService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">route</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.legacyService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">route</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(request);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"绞杀者模式的阶段规划\">绞杀者模式的阶段规划</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>活动</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>回滚策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1. 引入路由层</td>\n<td>在新旧系统前添加代理</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>移除代理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. 新建功能走新系统</td>\n<td>新功能只在新系统开发</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>Feature Flag 关闭</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. 逐个迁移旧功能</td>\n<td>一次迁移一个功能模块</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>按模块回滚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4. 淘汰旧系统</td>\n<td>确认所有流量走新系统后下线</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>保留旧系统一段时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"分支抽象-branch-by-abstraction\">分支抽象（Branch by Abstraction）</h2><p>分支抽象是 Martin Fowler 提出的在主干开发模式下进行大规模重构的方法——不使用长期分支，而是通过引入抽象层来隔离新旧实现。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 调用方&#10;    participant I as 抽象接口&#10;    participant O as 旧实现&#10;    participant N as 新实现&#10;&#10;    Note over C,N: 阶段 1: 引入抽象&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;I: 调用&#10;    I-&gt;&gt;O: 委托给旧实现&#10;&#10;    Note over C,N: 阶段 2: 新旧共存&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;I: 调用&#10;    I-&gt;&gt;N: 部分场景走新实现&#10;    I-&gt;&gt;O: 其余场景走旧实现&#10;&#10;    Note over C,N: 阶段 3: 完全切换&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;I: 调用&#10;    I-&gt;&gt;N: 全部走新实现&#10;&#10;    Note over C,N: 阶段 4: 清理&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;N: 直接调用(移除抽象层)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 调用方\n    participant I as 抽象接口\n    participant O as 旧实现\n    participant N as 新实现\n\n    Note over C,N: 阶段 1: 引入抽象\n    C-&gt;&gt;I: 调用\n    I-&gt;&gt;O: 委托给旧实现\n\n    Note over C,N: 阶段 2: 新旧共存\n    C-&gt;&gt;I: 调用\n    I-&gt;&gt;N: 部分场景走新实现\n    I-&gt;&gt;O: 其余场景走旧实现\n\n    Note over C,N: 阶段 3: 完全切换\n    C-&gt;&gt;I: 调用\n    I-&gt;&gt;N: 全部走新实现\n\n    Note over C,N: 阶段 4: 清理\n    C-&gt;&gt;N: 直接调用(移除抽象层)</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface NotificationSender {&#10;  send(userId: string, message: string): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;class LegacyEmailSender implements NotificationSender {&#10;  async send(userId: string, message: string): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;    await this.smtp.sendMail({ to: userId, body: message });&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;class ModernNotificationService implements NotificationSender {&#10;  async send(userId: string, message: string): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;    const preference = await this.getPreference(userId);&#10;    switch (preference.channel) {&#10;      case &#39;email&#39;:&#10;        return this.emailProvider.send(userId, message);&#10;      case &#39;push&#39;:&#10;        return this.pushProvider.send(userId, message);&#10;      case &#39;sms&#39;:&#10;        return this.smsProvider.send(userId, message);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NotificationSender</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LegacyEmailSender</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> i