试</td>\n<td>检测意外的输出变化</td>\n<td>API 响应、UI 渲染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>契约测试</td>\n<td>验证接口契约不变</td>\n<td>服务间通信</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"feature-flag-保护\">Feature Flag 保护</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const featureFlags = {&#10;  async isNewOrderFlowEnabled(): Promise&lt;boolean&gt; {&#10;    return flagService.evaluate(&#39;new-order-flow&#39;, {&#10;      rolloutPercentage: 10,&#10;      allowedUsers: [&#39;internal-testing&#39;],&#10;    });&#10;  },&#10;};&#10;&#10;async function processOrder(order: Order): Promise&lt;OrderResult&gt; {&#10;  if (await featureFlags.isNewOrderFlowEnabled()) {&#10;    return newOrderFlow(order);&#10;  }&#10;  return legacyOrderFlow(order);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> featureFlags</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isNewOrderFlowEnabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flagService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">evaluate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'new-order-flow'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      rolloutPercentage: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      allowedUsers: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'internal-testing'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">order</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">OrderResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> featureFlags.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isNewOrderFlowEnabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> newOrderFlow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> legacyOrderFlow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"重构策略选择指南\">重构策略选择指南</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐策略</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>替换整个子系统</td>\n<td>绞杀者模式</td>\n<td>逐步替换，风险可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>替换内部实现</td>\n<td>分支抽象</td>\n<td>主干开发友好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂依赖链</td>\n<td>Mikado 方法</td>\n<td>系统化处理依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修改公开接口</td>\n<td>并行变更</td>\n<td>不中断调用方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小规模代码改善</td>\n<td>直接重构</td>\n<td>测试保护下小步修改</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[重构需求] --&gt; B{规模?}&#10;    B --&gt;|函数/类级别| C[直接重构]&#10;    B --&gt;|模块级别| D{需要改接口?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[并行变更]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[分支抽象]&#10;    B --&gt;|系统级别| G{可以逐步迁移?}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[绞杀者模式]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| I[Mikado 方法]\">flowchart TD\n    A[重构需求] --&gt; B{规模?}\n    B --&gt;|函数/类级别| C[直接重构]\n    B --&gt;|模块级别| D{需要改接口?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[并行变更]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[分支抽象]\n    B --&gt;|系统级别| G{可以逐步迁移?}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[绞杀者模式]\n    G --&gt;|否| I[Mikado 方法]</pre><p>安全重构的核心不是某个具体技术，而是一种<strong>纪律</strong>——始终保持代码在可部署状态，始终有测试保护，始终小步前进。当你掌握了这套方法论，重构就从&quot;风险行为&quot;变成了&quot;日常实践&quot;，技术债务的偿还也从&quot;集中还款&quot;变成了&quot;持续分期&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>重构的风险在&quot;引入新 Bug&quot;，因此小步修改与测试保护是第一原则。</li>\n<li>重构策略应按变更规模匹配，而非用同一种手法处理所有情况。</li>\n<li>绞杀者模式与分支抽象让新旧实现并存，避免大爆炸重写。</li>\n<li>并行变更通过&quot;扩展—迁移—收缩&quot;三阶段保证调用方不中断。</li>\n<li>Mikado 方法用依赖图规划最小改动路径，适合深度耦合结构。</li>\n<li>测试与 Feature Flag 是重构的安全网，让每一步都可回退、可部署。</li>\n<li>本质是纪律：持续小步重构把债务偿还变成日常分期，而非集中还款。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"重构策略","id":"重构策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"安全重构的原则","id":"安全重构的原则"},{"level":2,"text":"绞杀者模式（Strangler Fig Pattern）","id":"绞杀者模式-strangler-fig-pattern"},{"level":3,"text":"实现方式","id":"实现方式"},{"level":3,"text":"绞杀者模式的阶段规划","id":"绞杀者模式的阶段规划"},{"level":2,"text":"分支抽象（Branch by Abstraction）","id":"分支抽象-branch-by-abstraction"},{"level":2,"text":"Mikado 方法","id":"mikado-方法"},{"level":3,"text":"Mikado 方法的步骤","id":"mikado-方法的步骤"},{"level":2,"text":"并行实现（Parallel Change）","id":"并行实现-parallel-change"},{"level":3,"text":"并行变更的三阶段","id":"并行变更的三阶段"},{"level":2,"text":"重构的安全网","id":"重构的安全网"},{"level":3,"text":"测试策略","id":"测试策略"},{"level":3,"text":"Feature Flag 保护","id":"feature-flag-保护"},{"level":2,"text":"重构策略选择指南","id":"重构策略选择指南"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"债务量化与优先级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-craftsmanship/tech-debt-engineering/debt-quantification-prioritization"},"next":{"title":"遗留代码现代化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-craftsmanship/tech-debt-engineering/legacy-code-modernization"}}